  "question": {
    "html": "<p>P and Q are two parallel conducting plates where P is negatively charged and Q is positively charged. The distance between P and Q is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"x\"></span>. When an electron is placed at a distance of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{x}{3}\"></span> from Q, the electric force experienced by the electron is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"F\"></span>.</p>\n<p>What is the force experienced by the electron when the distance between P and Q is increased to <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"3x\"></span> and the electron is placed at a distance of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{x}{3}\"></span> from Q?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{F}{3}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{F}{9}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"F\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"3F\"></span></li>\n</ol>"
  },
